        "id": 1463964
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-01-21T21:46:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think SubownerUids makes sense, given that this value somewhat mirrors the owner uid identity. Changed references to use \u0027SubownerUids\u0027.",
      "parentUuid": "eb719d7a_eef1d545",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 863,
        "startChar": 33,
